<title>USA: Arlington CSD, N.Y., won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Arlington CSD, N.Y., won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it won $20 million of Arlington CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.58 percent.</p>
</text>
